      "id": "CVE-2026-138050",
      "publishedDate": "2026-11-28T13:15:22.390Z",
      "lastModifiedDate": "2026-11-28T13:15:22.390Z",
      "description": "A weakness has been identified in OpenAirInterface oai-cn5g-udr up to 2.2.2. This vulnerability affects unknown code of the file src/udr_app/database/mysql_db.cpp of the component Nudr_DR. Executing a manipulation of the argument ueId can lead to sql injection. The attack may be launched remotely. The exploit has been made available to the public and could be used for attacks. The vendor was contacted early about this disclosure.",
      "severity": 7.3,
      "fix_suggestion": "📦 受影响组件：OpenAirInterface oai-cn5g-udr\n🛠️ 修复建议：\n1. 确认受影响的版本范围（见上方 Affected Products）\n2. 升级到厂商官方发布的最稳定安全版本\n3. 检查官方安全公告获取补丁链接\n4. 如无法立即升级，实施临时缓解措施：\n   - 网络层：WAF 规则 / IPS 签名 / 零信任策略\n   - 主机层：最小化暴露面 / 禁用危险功能 / 输入过滤\n5. 修复后使用 NVD / 厂商 PoC 验证修复有效性",
